# No custom environment values or secrets are required for WEB-M0-002.
# NODE_ENV is required by the server schema and supplied by Next.js/Vitest:
# development (npm run dev), production (npm run build/start), test (npm test).
# Invalid/empty values fail validation without echoing their contents.
# Public environment allowlist is intentionally empty.
# Never prefix a secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
